# OpenGGS furnace convention — PASS 2.
#
# What changed from pass 1, and WHY: pass 1's slag was ten shapes, all
# `EventKindNotInConvention`, ranked ScopeExit/ScopeEnter 3487 each, Condition
# 1688, Branch 1617, Call 1260, Decl 353, Cast 346, Param 139, Break 69,
# Return 26. Each shape named exactly one row to add. This file is that list,
# turned into config — no Rust changed between the two passes.
#
# Concerns are assigned HERE, per kind, at the corpus-wide default depth. That
# assignment is the thing the furnace module is forbidden from knowing.

classify Read
classify Write
classify ReadWrite
classify Decl
classify Call
classify Condition
classify Branch
classify Cast
classify Param
classify Break
classify Return
classify ScopeEnter
classify ScopeExit

row depth=0 concern=State     kind=Read
row depth=0 concern=State     kind=Write
row depth=0 concern=State     kind=ReadWrite
row depth=0 concern=State     kind=Decl
row depth=0 concern=Control   kind=Condition
row depth=0 concern=Control   kind=Branch
row depth=0 concern=Control   kind=Break
row depth=0 concern=Control   kind=Return
row depth=0 concern=Structure kind=ScopeEnter
row depth=0 concern=Structure kind=ScopeExit
row depth=0 concern=Interface kind=Call
row depth=0 concern=Interface kind=Param
row depth=0 concern=Conversion kind=Cast
